#. translators: %s: a measured cost, e.g. "more than 8 minutes on a 440,000-row table (MySQL 8)".
#: src/Migration/Migrations/AddUserAgentDimension.php:108
#, php-format
msgid "Groundwork for a future release: no report gets faster today. The slowest step here: %s."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: a measured cost, e.g. "more than 8 minutes on a 440,000-row table (MySQL 8)".
#: src/Migration/Migrations/AddUserAgentDimension.php:117
#, php-format
msgid "Optional. Adds a compact browser key to the analytics table and to the archive table, and builds a lookup of browsers and platforms. It is groundwork for a future release. It does not make any report faster today, and it is by far the slowest step here: %s. That run was stopped before it finished, so it is a minimum and not an estimate. On a larger table you may not be able to complete it from this screen at all. Your existing data is not modified, and reports keep working while it runs. Tracking normally keeps working too. If the server cannot rebuild online, the step stays pending; retry later or ask your host for help."
msgstr ""

#: src/Migration/Migrations/AddVisitIdentity.php:71
msgid "Add the anonymous visitor identity column"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: a measured cost, e.g. "about 8 seconds on a 440,000-row table (MySQL 8)".
#: src/Migration/Migrations/AddVisitIdentity.php:78
#, php-format
msgid "Groups visitors tracked without cookies into visits. Each table takes %s."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %s: a measured cost, e.g. "about 8 seconds on a 440,000-row table (MySQL 8)".
#: src/Migration/Migrations/AddVisitIdentity.php:87
#, php-format
msgid "Adds a private, full-width identity column for visitors tracked without cookies. Until it runs, anonymous pageviews are still recorded but cost extra database work on every hit and cannot be grouped into visits reliably. The analytics table and its archive are each rebuilt in place: %s, so roughly double that if you also have archived data, and longer on bigger tables. Tracking and reports normally keep working while it runs. If the server cannot rebuild online, the step stays pending; retry later or ask your host for help. No existing data is changed or removed."
msgstr ""

#: src/Migration/Migrations/ConvertTablesToUtf8mb4.php:115
