#. translators: %s: a measured cost, e.g. "about 12 seconds on a 440,000-row table (MySQL 8)".
#: src/Migration/Migrations/ConvertTablesToUtf8mb4.php:131
#, php-format
msgid "Converts the SlimStat tables from utf8 (3-byte) to utf8mb4 so they can store emoji and match the collation WordPress uses for users. This rebuilds each table and pauses tracking writes while it runs: %s for the largest of them."
